    "name": "City Suites - Kaohsiung Pier2 Hotel",
    "detail": "It was our first time in Kaohsiung - a vibrant city filled with culture, history and art. KaohSiung Pier2 Hotel was located near Bo-Ai district, in which you can explore many places to inspire the artist in you. If you are a foodie, rest assured that you will have access to plenty of food near this area. If you are a couple, the love river is just in the vicinity - perfect for a stroll in the night. When i first booked the room, I could hardly believe the price i got it for. The staffs were exceptionally welcoming and accomodating. The room concept was simplistic, yet intricately. The semi-open concept appealed to me the most. Overall, i'd give this hotel a 10/10 for value for money. ",
